{"seq":2,"slug":"bifurcation","title":"分岔","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/nonlinear-dynamics-chaos/bifurcation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bifurcations","title":"分岔类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/nonlinear-dynamics-chaos/bifurcation/bifurcations","wordCount":1713,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"routes-to-chaos","title":"通往混沌之路 (倍周期)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/nonlinear-dynamics-chaos/bifurcation/routes-to-chaos","wordCount":1608,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"logistic-map","title":"逻辑斯蒂映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/nonlinear-dynamics-chaos/bifurcation/logistic-map","wordCount":1540,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"分岔\">分岔</h1><p>一个系统的参数缓慢漂移，大多数时候它的定性行为纹丝不动；但在某些临界参数值上，不动点会突然出现或消失、稳定性会瞬间翻转、周期轨道会成对诞生。这种「定性结构的突变」就是分岔，它是连接「规则行为」与「混沌」的桥梁。本章三篇文档把这座桥铺完。</p>\n<p>第一篇 <a href=\"bifurcations\">分岔类型</a> 建立积木：鞍结、跨临界、叉式三类一维局部分岔，以及二维里催生极限环的 Hopf 分岔。每一类都配标准型方程与分岔图，告诉你「在临界点两侧不动点的数目与稳定性如何改变」。这是理解一切复杂分岔现象的最小词汇表。</p>\n<p>第二篇 <a href=\"routes-to-chaos\">通往混沌之路 (倍周期)</a> 把积木串成路径：周期 1 失稳变周期 2、周期 2 变周期 4……倍周期级联在有限参数区间内积累出无穷多次分岔，终点就是混沌。Feigenbaum 常数让这条路具有普适性。本篇还简述准周期与阵发两条替代路线。</p>\n<p>第三篇 <a href=\"logistic-map\">逻辑斯蒂映射</a> 用一个具体到极致的例子收束全章：一行迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{n+1}=rx_n(1-x_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 就把倍周期级联、窗口、自相似全部呈现在一张轨道图上。它是整个混沌领域被研究得最透的「果蝇」。</p>\n<p>读本章前请先掌握 <a href=\"../foundations/fixed-points-stability\">不动点与稳定性</a>，因为分岔本质上就是「稳定性如何随参数丢失」。本章产出的倍周期路线，将在 <a href=\"../chaos/\">混沌</a> 一章里被赋予 Lyapunov 指数这一定量判据。</p>\n"}